  "shownotes_html": "<p><span>这期节目，请来了我的老朋友老于和大山。作为一名金融行业从业者，老于在繁忙工作之余，以养鱼为乐，办公室的生态缸成为他心灵的栖息地。节目里，他分享了如何用低成本打造一个自我循环的微观生态系统，让鱼虾在缸中繁衍生息，为工作环境增添生机。养鱼不仅是爱好，更是他对生命的思考，从鱼虾的日常中体悟生活哲理，找到内心的平静与满足。</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>老于、大山</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>羊行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>录制日期：</span></strong><span>2025年4月3日</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>发布日期：</span></strong><span>2025年4月28日</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期核心话题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</a> 金融从业者老于的养鱼乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"161\">02:41</a> 养鱼成本与心理价值的探讨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqCgpp7sGQ3iq9ofcdN3-JDXvifb.png\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"318\">05:18</a> 中年男人的办公室养鱼乐趣</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhiWDtV5QJSGTvCvt8ORY9mh-gYf.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"380\">06:20</a> 鱼缸里的小世界：滋养与反思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"540\">09:00</a> 生态缸的构建与维护经验分享</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FurOKx-ssCljgZGMwbO9FsZyMF_K.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"796\">13:16</a> 鱼缸养护及生物选择经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"966\">16:06</a> 构建办公室微生态：从苹果螺到黄金显的探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1173\">19:33</a> 水族箱植物的作用与维护方法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRujiaDFAiR-KxV5eNLT3d-Ww0N.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1261\">21:01</a> 生态缸的维护与生态平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1353\">22:33</a> 探讨养鱼的流派与生态构建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1513\">25:13</a> 养鱼经历与感悟：生态平衡与生命循环</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr523DWEDjVWemFVAcQYLQE3LPDU.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1619\">26:59</a> 生态缸中的动态平衡与生命感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1781\">29:41</a> 办公室内的自然生活与心理调剂</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期金句</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>「鱼缸放在那儿，他们自己安好，对我们而言也是心里的安好。」​</span><br><span>​​「我们也是在一个巨大的缸里，你逃也逃不脱，每天在这里绕圈。」​</span><br><span>「老老实实吃饭，认认真真长个儿，最后他就自然而然成了霸主。」</span><br><span>「居心地可能是你家里某一个角落，或是办公桌上愿意抽离的地方。」</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>苦中找乐行动指南</span></strong></p><span></span><h4><strong><span>1. 低成本治愈法：打造你的“微型避难所”</span></strong></h4><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>行动</span></strong><span>：用100元预算，在办公桌/家中角落布置一个生态缸（陶缸+荷塘泥+清江鱼+黑壳虾）。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>核心</span></strong><span>：无需复杂设备，通过观察自然循环，让压力随鱼游走。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h4><strong><span>2. 职场“居心地”法则：抽离5分钟，重启大脑</span></strong></h4><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>行动</span></strong><span>：每天花5分钟凝视生态缸或绿植，专注呼吸，切断工作焦虑。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>核心</span></strong><span>：用物理空间切换心理状态，避免情绪过载。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h4><strong><span>3. 硬核回收哲学：万物皆可循环</span></strong></h4><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>行动</span></strong><span>：将枯萎植物、鱼虾遗体埋入绿植盆，命名“生命转化实验”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>核心</span></strong><span>：用仪式感赋予失去意义，接受无常。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>配乐：</span></strong><span>Queen / David Bowie - Under Pressure</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>后期：</span></strong><span>西红是番茄</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>订阅《苦中找乐》：</span></strong><span>你能想到的平台都可以找到并订阅。</span></p>",
